[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1223.35, "timestamp": "00:20:23", "text": "的朋友，如果我們關係很親密，我會說：「我知道我們是朋友，我是個好朋友，我只是想營造一種氛圍，這樣可以，對吧？這樣可以。」然後"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1233.59, "timestamp": "00:20:33", "text": "我就可以理解他們，也能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1236.23, "timestamp": "00:20:36", "text": "看出哪裡出了問題，等等"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1239.19, "timestamp": "00:20:39", "text": "等等。但這次感覺更像是，人們認為我接近他們只是為了瀏覽量、金錢利益，為了在我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1243.909, "timestamp": "00:20:43", "text": "頻道上增加粉絲。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1248.019, "timestamp": "00:20:48", "author": "@Her_escapes", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/k5qSeiW9HuWS-yTlvFtkJFgjFQNzT4clVmOKs1PPP76ezfBidoUedboWgIi3wJy0ffSGpxX2Gy8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "exactly! but there are too many immature ppl out there"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1248.789, "timestamp": "00:20:48", "text": "這就是我為什麼和你們合作的原因。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1256.71, "timestamp": "00:20:56", "text": "我真不懂為什麼有人會這麼想。比如說，就算"}]